{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumBloch.pentagon_uv_commutation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.pentagon_uv_commutation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.pentagon_uv_commutation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.pentagon_uv_commutation","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L61-L86","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\n$$\n  \\Phi_q(v)\\,\\Phi_q(u) \\;=\\; \\Phi_q(u)\\,\\Phi_q(uv)\\,\\Phi_q(v)\n$$\n\n    The Lean encoding below derives the manuscript's five sub-claims\n    from the context class fields (the genuine operator identities:\n    pentagon master, Hecke braid relation, descent involution,\n    scalar-descended commutation, transient quantum-torus relation). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:pentagon-uv-commutation","label":"prop:pentagon-uv-commutation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pentagon-uv-commutation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_iv_operator_lift_transient","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_iv_operator_lift_transient","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (iv) — Operator lift: on the transient summand\n`ker τ̂_n` the surviving commutation between the level-`n` and\nlevel-`(n+1)` lifts is the **quantum-torus relation** `Û V̂ = q V̂ Û`,\ni.e. `u v = q • v u` (`R`-scalar action of `q`).  This is the\n`uv = q vu` prerequisite the pentagon identity rests on; encodes the\nreal identity (replacing the former empty `: Prop`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_iii_eigenvalue_specialisation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_iii_eigenvalue_specialisation","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (iii) — Eigenvalue specialisation reduces\nthe descended part to scalar form where commutation is **trivial**:\n`u₀ v₀ = v₀ u₀` (two traced scalar volumes at a fixed jet level\ncommute, the level-internal lemma `lem:vhat-pair-commutation-trace`).\nEncodes the real identity (replacing the former empty `: Prop`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.v_descended","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.v_descended","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.u_descended","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.u_descended","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The descended (scalar) lifts `u₀, v₀` of `V̂_i, V̂_j` at a single\njet level — the image of `τ̂_n`, where the eigenvalue\nspecialisation has reduced the operators to scalar Laurent\npolynomials. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_ii_descent_involution_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_ii_descent_involution_split","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L39-L39","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (ii) — Descent involution: `τ̂_n` squares\nto the identity, separating `H_n(R, q)` into ±1 eigenspaces\n(descended / transient parts). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.tau_hat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.tau_hat","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Descent involution `τ̂_n : R → R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_i_hecke_braid_relation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_i_hecke_braid_relation","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (i) — Hecke braid relation at the operator\nlevel: `σ_s σ_{s+1} σ_s = σ_{s+1} σ_s σ_{s+1}` for every `s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.σ","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Hecke generator family `σ : ℕ → R` (`σ s` represents `σ_s`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_pentagon_master","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.claim_pentagon_master","kind":"theorem","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Manuscript master identity (pentagon UV commutation):\n`Φ_q(v) · Φ_q(u) = Φ_q(u) · Φ_q(uv) · Φ_q(v)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.v","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L22-L22","doc":"The level-shift operator lift `V̂` of `V̂_j` (transient summand). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.u","kind":"def","line":20,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L20-L20","doc":"The level-shift operator lift `Û` of `V̂_i` (transient summand). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.Phi_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.Phi_q","kind":"def","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L18-L18","doc":"The dilogarithm `Φ_q : R → R` (`q`-deformed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L16-L16","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L16-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumBloch.PentagonUvCommutationContext","kind":"class","line":14,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumBloch/pentagon_uv_commutation.lean#L14-L60","doc":"Abstract context for the `pentagon_uv_commutation` claim — manuscript-themed\ntyped fields below carry the genuine operator identities. ","signatureChunk":0}]}